---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Licensing — Rod Machen Photography"
  description="Copyright and licensing information for Rod Machen's photography."
>
  <article class="licensing-page">
    <h1>Copyright &amp; Licensing</h1>

    <p>
      All photographs on this site are &copy; Rod Machen. All rights reserved.
    </p>

    <p>
      My images may not be downloaded, reproduced, printed, copied, or distributed
      in any form without prior written permission.
    </p>

    <h2>What&#39;s not permitted without a license</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Editorial use in publications, blogs, or news outlets</li>
      <li>Commercial use in advertising, marketing, or products</li>
      <li>Print reproduction of any kind</li>
      <li>Posting or sharing on social media without credit and prior approval</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Licensing &amp; permissions</h2>

    <p>
      If you&#39;d like to license an image for editorial, commercial, or personal
      use, I&#39;d love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Email:</strong>{' '}
      <a href="mailto:mail@rodmachen.com">mail@rodmachen.com</a>
    </p>

    <p>Please include in your inquiry:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Which image(s) you&#39;re interested in</li>
      <li>Intended use (editorial, commercial, personal print, etc.)</li>
      <li>Publication or platform</li>
      <li>Desired usage period</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Attribution &amp; credit</h2>

    <p>
      When permission is granted, credit should read:{' '}
      <strong>&copy; Rod Machen / rodmachen.com</strong>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .licensing-page {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .licensing-page h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .licensing-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .licensing-page p,
  .licensing-page li {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .licensing-page ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .licensing-page li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .licensing-page a {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
